    <p class="author-bio__desc">
      Sam has cut suits by hand for over thirty years — the last decade-plus from his own atelier
      in Vaughan, on the Thornhill line. Bespoke and made-to-measure suits, wedding parties for the
      groom, groomsmen and fathers, and traditional Jewish menswear, for men across the GTA. Every
      garment is measured, cut and fitted personally — never outsourced.
    </p>
    <div class="author-bio__links">
      <a href="/about">More about Sam</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
